 "notes": [
  "Posted 24 July 2001 with no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The post has no starting section; the Objective Bring Him Before Me / Take Your Father's Place is listed last under 'Objective (1)' and the strategy says to 'start your basic old school setup of BHBM'. No starting interrupt or effect is named.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Docking Bay 97' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 (Dark): there is no Docking Bay 97 card and 94 is the only numbered Tatooine docking bay.",
  "Posted 'Emperor Palpatine 2' read as two copies of Emperor Palpatine (Death Star II); with that the characters total 20 against the header's 21.",
  "Posted 'Endor Landing Platform (Docking Bay)' dested the Dark page Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark).",
  "The section headers add up to 60, but the cards listed total 59; kept as published."
